WEBVTT

00:01:29.913 --> 00:01:32.663
or robot in English [and in French].

00:01:34.954 --> 00:01:37.329
“R.U.R.” was wildly successful,

00:01:37.329 --> 00:01:40.454
and when it was translated
into English in 1923,

00:01:40.454 --> 00:01:43.371
the word robot was
enthusiastically adopted.

00:01:45.788 --> 00:01:47.621
Although most of today’s robots

00:01:47.621 --> 00:01:50.788
look quite different than Capek imagined,

00:01:50.788 --> 00:01:53.996
they’ve become just as popular
as he predicted.

00:01:54.621 --> 00:01:56.954
However, unlike R.U.R.,

00:01:56.954 --> 00:01:59.829
our robots have not yet 
rebelled against us,

00:01:59.829 --> 00:02:01.996
and here’s hoping it stays that way!